flowchart LR
    Computer[计算机] --> Hardware[硬件]
    Computer --> Software[软件]
    Computer --> Data[数据]
    Hardware --> CPU[CPU]
    Hardware --> RAM[内存 RAM]
    Hardware --> Storage[持久化存储]
    Software --> Program[程序]
    Software --> OS[操作系统]
    Input[输入] --> Computer
    Computer --> Output[输出]
    Automation[自动化] --> Program
